    <KeyInsights>
        <Insight id="1">
            <Subject>Odoo Course Performance</Subject>
            <Description>Delivered the highest volume of messaging conversations (183) at the lowest cost per result (7.71 EGP), indicating strong market demand for ERP accounting training.</Description>
        </Insight>
        <Insight id="2">
            <Subject>Video vs Static Ad Creative</Subject>
            <Description>Video creatives reduced the cost per messaging result by approximately 39.3% in the tax course (13.44 EGP vs 22.15 EGP for static ads).</Description>
        </Insight>
        <Insight id="3">
            <Subject>Bundle Offer Viability</Subject>
            <Description>The All-in-One bundle ad set proved cost-effective at 9.08 EGP per result, demonstrating high perceived value among target accountants.</Description>
        </Insight>
        <Insight id="4">
            <Subject>Budget Drain</Subject>
            <Description>The mystery/engagement promo post resulted in an excessive CPR of 51.47 EGP and low CTR (1.95%), failing to generate cost-effective qualified inquiries.</Description>
        </Insight>
    </KeyInsights>

    <StrategicRecommendations>
        <Recommendation priority="High">
            <Action>Reactivate Odoo Campaign</Action>
            <Details>Relaunch the Odoo course campaign with an allocated daily budget of 250 to 300 EGP to maximize low-cost lead generation.</Details>
        </Recommendation>
        <Recommendation priority="High">
            <Action>Expand Video Creatives</Action>
            <Details>Produce short video reels (60-90 seconds) for the Audit and Odoo courses, replicating the success observed in the Tax video campaign.</Details>
        </Recommendation>
        <Recommendation priority="Medium">
            <Action>Scale All-in-One Offer</Action>
            <Details>Position the All-in-One package as an entry or upsell offer to leverage its low CPR (9.08 EGP).</Details>
        </Recommendation>
        <Recommendation priority="Medium">
            <Action>Refine Audit Course Angle</Action>
            <Details>Revise ad copy and value proposition for the audit course to address office accreditation, career progression, and practical case studies to lower the 26.03 EGP CPR.</Details>
        </Recommendation>
    </StrategicRecommendations>
